    dmo:evidenceQuote "T1D Y early starting 5 years after diagnosis" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "An ACEi or ARB is recommended for patients with T1D or T2D who have hypertension and albuminuria, titrated to the maximum antihypertensive or highest tolerated dose." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/ada-kdigo-consensus-report-diabetes-ckd-diabetes-care-2022> .

